# Preset avatars live here as static assets: preset-01.webp … preset-10.webp.
#
# Vite copies public/ to the build root as-is, so these are served at
# /avatars/<file> — see src/data/avatarPresets.json for the manifest and
# src/services/avatarApi.js (listPresets) for the path building.
#
# They deliberately do NOT go through Supabase Storage: they ship with the
# app, are identical for every user, and only change when a file is committed.
#
# This placeholder keeps the directory in git until the real .webp files land.
